# Byte-exact goldens for `to-json` over all fixtures.

```console
$ ar7json to-json tests/fixtures/minimal.ar7
{
  "document": {
    "entries": [
      {
        "key": "meta",
        "value": {
          "entries": [
            {
              "key": "encoding",
              "value": {
                "raw": "/"utf-8/"",
                "type": "string",
                "value": "utf-8"
              }
            }
          ],
          "type": "object"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "format": "ar7json",
  "version": 1
}

```

